# 1. 邮件协议标准端口全量直连 (IMAP/POP3/SMTP/Exchange，阻断机场节点封邮件端口)
DST-PORT,25,DIRECT
DST-PORT,109,DIRECT
DST-PORT,110,DIRECT
DST-PORT,143,DIRECT
DST-PORT,220,DIRECT
DST-PORT,465,DIRECT
DST-PORT,587,DIRECT
DST-PORT,993,DIRECT
DST-PORT,995,DIRECT
DST-PORT,2525,DIRECT

